# Generated, regenerable simulation and analysis output stays out of git (the
# sibling electron_thruster repo once tracked 95 GB of dumps).  The only
# committed results are small, curated artifacts under each stage's
# reference_results/ (see ARCHITECTURE_REFACTOR_PLAN.md section 12).
**/outputs/
**/results/
**/viz/*.mp4
suite_results/
**/__pycache__/
*.log
